  "description": "Reserved matters application in relation to hybrid planning permission 15/5550 (as amended by planning permission 17/0328, 18/2214 and 20/2844) for the landscaping for North East Lands Enabling Works comprising of demolition of existing structures; the removal of the existing hard standing; below ground operational works comprising the installation of the foul water and surface water network; the installation of the attenuation tanks; the installation of the district heat network; and the installation of utilities required ready the site for the future construction of Plots NE02 and NE03 and to allow for future connection to Plots NE01, NE04, NE05 and NE06.Information is provided to discharge the following conditions for the North East Lands Enabling Works. 1:\tLandscaping19(i):\tSite Wide Heat Network19(j):\tLocation of Services27:\tConstruction Logistics Plan37:\tConstruction Method Statement42:\tSite Investigation and Remediation Strategy45: \tDrainage47:\tSurface Water Drainage Strategy49:\tPhasing Plan",
